{"t":"Midnight Shard","s":"midnight-shard-a4040","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Midnight_Shard_cb3c6e.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Midnight Shard</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Midnight Shard\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Midnight_Shard_cb3c6e.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Items<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 - 30,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090617160933&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Midnight_Shard_cb3c6e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a midnight shard.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 3.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Lucius might be interested in those shards.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It can be obtained throughout and as reward of <a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a> event.\n</p><p>Can be traded for experience points with <a href=\"#/wiki/Lucius\">Lucius</a> during and after succeeding in <a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a> event. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Game%20Worlds\">Game World</a> that has failed the event can not exchange them. \n</p><p>For each Midnight Shard, characters can gain <span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\"><math alttext=\"{\\displaystyle 300 \\cdot L}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n<mn>300</mn>\n<mo>⋅<!-- ⋅ --></mo>\n<mi>L</mi>\n</mstyle>\n</mrow>\n<annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle 300 \\cdot L}</annotation>\n</semantics>\n</math></span></span> experience; L being the character's level. Note that the formula is not <span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\"><math alttext=\"{\\displaystyle \\sum_{i=1}^{N} 300L_i}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n<munderover>\n<mo>∑<!-- ∑ --></mo>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mi>i</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mi>N</mi>\n</mrow>\n</munderover>\n<mn>300</mn>\n<msub>\n<mi>L</mi>\n<mi>i</mi>\n</msub>\n</mstyle>\n</mrow>\n<annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle \\sum_{i=1}^{N} 300L_i}</annotation>\n</semantics>\n</math></span></span> (for N shards), so if a character levels up by using one shard, they will gain 300 more experience per shard for the next level. Thus, it is slightly better to trade them incrementally than all at once. Check the table for better results. \n</p><p>A character can trade up to 80 shards for experience per year. However, an arbitrary amount of shards can be traded for gold.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-2009\">2009</span></h4>\n<p>Previously, the shards gave <span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\"><math alttext=\"{\\displaystyle 30 \\cdot L}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n<mn>30</mn>\n<mo>⋅<!-- ⋅ --></mo>\n<mi>L</mi>\n</mstyle>\n</mrow>\n<annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle 30 \\cdot L}</annotation>\n</semantics>\n</math></span></span> experience and was also lootable from monsters on the good side of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Light\">Temple of Light</a> if the event ends in success. The adjustment came as a result of the raising of the shards' rarity.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-2011\">2011</span></h4>\n<p>During 2011, some players could trade up to 80 shards. Players who had not talked to Lucius yet after the November 12 patch could have their shard trade count reset after their next conversation with Lucius. For example, if one took 80 shards with them to Lucius, asked to trade all for experience, 40 would be traded; ending the conversation with 'bye' and repeating the process with the 40 remaining shards would allow the final 40 to be traded for experience. This was not a bug - it is the compensation for a bug in which some players could not trade 40 shards.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-2024\">2024</span></h4>\n<p>The August 6 2024 patch increased the number of tradable shards from 40 to 80 and removed the level cap (of 200) for redeeming midnight shards.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Acolyte%20of%20Darkness\">Acolyte of Darkness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20of%20Light\">Bane of Light</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bride%20of%20Night\">Bride of Night</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Doomsday%20Cultist\">Doomsday Cultist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duskbringer\">Duskbringer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Herald%20of%20Gloom\">Herald of Gloom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Spawn\">Midnight Spawn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Warrior\">Midnight Warrior</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightslayer\">Nightslayer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Hound\">Shadow Hound</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Lucius\">Lucius</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Light\">Temple of Light</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Acolyte%20of%20Darkness\">Acolyte of Darkness</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20of%20Light\">Bane of Light</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bride%20of%20Night\">Bride of Night</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Doomsday%20Cultist\">Doomsday Cultist</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duskbringer\">Duskbringer</a></li><li>Event Creatures</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Herald%20of%20Gloom\">Herald of Gloom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lucius\">Lucius</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Spawn\">Midnight Spawn</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Warrior\">Midnight Warrior</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightslayer\">Nightslayer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Hound\">Shadow Hound</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Light\">Temple of Light</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quests</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-lightbearer"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-lightbearer","quest":"The Lightbearer","step":"3-3","n":22,"title":"Recolher as mochilas","kind":"reward","coords":[]}],"sell":[{"npc":"Lucius","where":"Temple of Light","price":1000,"pos":{"x":32892,"y":31094,"z":7},